			<h5 style="text-align:center;">Oconee Emergency Food Pantry</h5>
			<div class="py-5"></div>
			<p style="text-align:center;">For many in our county, food insecurity is real. Whether it’s a struggling single mom, an elderly couple or a homeless individual, The Salvation Army helps Oconee residents with emergency needs of grocery items. You can help support our food pantry by donating funds, dropping off in-date, nonperishable food items, or by helping to date and stock pantry items.</p>
