<p>
	Donate in-date, nonperishable canned goods and food items. Click below for our shopping list.
</p>

<p>
	Drop items off at 100 Debra Street, Seneca.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center;" class="cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center"><a href="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/e9272330-c6c6-47c5-8a04-9d14002cbd1b_Grocery+list+single.pdf" class="btn btn-secondary gap-1 mt-2">Shopping List</a></p></div></div>
